    <description>06/01/26 (GD) – Replaces DLRS TotalCostOfAssetsOnPurchasingOp rule. On update when Cost__c or Purchasing_Opportunity__c changes, sums ProductItem__c.Cost__c onto Opportunity.Total_Cost_of_Assets__c. Runs synchronously to support reparenting via $Record__Prior. On reparent, updates both old and new Opportunity.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
